  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NEH 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogwatanana korwa ase abamenyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko riria abanto bagasomerwa amang’ana Korea ase Egetabu kia Musa, na ekanyorekana eriikire ng’a Abaamoni na Abamoabu tibakobarwa ase omosangererekano bw’abaanto ba Nyasae nonya ng’ake,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera tibachiete korotota Abaisraeli na kobaa endagera na amaache. Barabwo bakaa Baalamu eng’eria ng’a aragererie Abaisraeli, korende Nyasae akaonchora okoragereria koria gokaba ogosesenigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abaisraeli baigwete amachiiko ayio asometwe ase bare bakerusanania korwa ase abanto bonsi abarenge ab’ebisaku ebiao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nehemia okoirania Abaisraeli bamoiroke Nyasae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero engaki eyio konya etaraika, Eliasibu Omokuani oria ochoretwe akaba omoteneneri ase ebinyomba biarenge chikungo, agwo ase enyomba ya Nyasae oito, nigo abwatanete na Tobia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere konya oroiseirie Tobia enyomba engare agwo aase konya barenge kogaacha okoruegwa kw’endagera, na ubani, na ebikorero, ne chinsemo chia ikomi chi’endagera, na edivai, na amaguta ’amazeituni, ebinto biachikeretwe Abalawi, na abateri, na abarendi b’ebiita. Boigo ebiegwa biachikeretwe abakuani, nao biare kogachwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche tinarenge Yerusalemu ekero amang’ana ayio abeete iga, ekiagera ase omwaka bw’emerongo etato, na ebere, bw’okogamba kw’Aritasasita, omorwoti o Babiloni, nario nagendete ase omorwoti oyio. Magega y’engaki ende nkaegwa ribaga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkairana Yerusalemu, nkaigwa igoro y’ebibe ebio Eliasibu akorete ase okoroiseria Tobia enyomba agwo ase chikungo chi’enyomba ya Nyasae chiarenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio nkaba nendamwamu enene ngatuguta ebinto bia nyomba bia Tobia korwa ase enyomba eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkarua ogochika, na aase agwo agachenwa, erio nkairaniao ebikorero bi’enyomba ya Nyasae, amo nokoruegwa kw’endagera na ubani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende nkanyora ng’a Abalawi na abateri konya batamire korwao, na kera oyomo konya ogendire ase omogondo oye, ekiagera tibaetwe chinsemo chiabo chiabatungetie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nkomana nabanene nkababoria, “Nase ki enyomba ya Nyasae yatigirwe etarendiri?” Nkabasangereria na nkabeka kera omonto aase aye akore emeremo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abayuda bonsi bakarenta ase chikungo ensemo ya ikomi y’okoruegwa kw’endagera, na edivai, na amaguta ’amazeituni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngachora Selemia Omokuani, na Zadoki, omworokia bw’amachiiko, na Pedaya Omolawi, bakaba abagachi be chikungo. Naende nkabeka Hanani, mosinto o Sakuri o Matania, akaba omokonyi obo, ekiagera abwo bonsi nigo baberetwe kirori ng’a nabegenwa bare. Emeremo yabo nigo yarenge ey’ogwatananera Abayuda bamwabo ebinto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Nyasae one, ong’inyore ase engencho y’amang’ana ayio. Tobaisa gotinyia ogokora kwane okuya nakorire ase enyomba yao na ase emeremo ere aroro ey’okogokorera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eyio nkarora agwo ase ense y’Abayuda abanto barenge komita edivai ase rituko ri’Esabato. Boigo bakarenta endagera na bakabeekera chitigere chigurube; naende nigo barenge korenta edivai, na amasabibu, na amako, ne chigurube chinde ao ao ase Yerusalemu ase rituko ri’Esabato. Nkabakuurera bokong’u tibaabaisa koonia endagera ase rituko erio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto ba Turo, abamenyete ase omochie oria, nigo barenge korenta chinswe, na ebinto binde bionsi, na kobiooneria Abayuda na abanto ba Yerusalemu, ase rituko ri’Esabato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio inche nkomana nabanene b’Abayuda, nkabateebia, “Mbibe ki ebi mogokora ase ogokora rituko ri’Esabato koba eritachenegeti?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Chisokoro chiaino tichiakorete obobe buna obo, chikagera Nyasae oito akarenta amabe aya onsi ase tore na ase omochie oyo? Bono nigo morigetie korentera Abaisraeli endamwamu ya Nyasae ere enene goetania, ase ogokora Esabato koba eyetachenegeti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, ekero bwaisire koira, ekero Esabato etarachaka, nigo naruete ogochika ng’a ebiita bia Yerusalemu bisiekwe, na bigenderere gosiekwa goika ekero Esabato eraere. Nkabeka abasomba baane bande korenda ase ebiita barore ng’a gurube ende terentwa ime ase omochie, ase rituko ri’Esabato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaonchoreria na abaoonia bande bonsi nigo barenge korara isiko ya Yerusalemu ase rituko rigima, gose abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nkabakuurera na kobateebia, “Nase ki mobeerete isiko aa na korara aa ase enyasi? Moise gokora bo naende, goika mbakore bobe.” Korwa ase engaki eria na kogenderera tibarenge gocha ase rituko ri’Esabato.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngachiika Abalawi bechene, erio bachiche korenda ebiita na korenda rituko ri’Esabato ribe richenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aye Nyasae one, ing’inyore boigo ase engencho y’amang’ana aya, na ondorere amaabera, ekiagera aye nigo ore nobwanchani botari koera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engaki eria boigo nkarora Abayuda bande banyuomete abakungu korwa ase chinse chi’Abaasidodi na Abaamoni, na Abamoabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekeng’ese ki’abana babo nigo barenge gokwana omonwa bw’Egesidodi gose oyo bw’egesaku kende, korende tibamanyete gokwana omonwa bw’Ekeyuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nkomania abanto abwo, nkabaragereria; ngaaka abande abwo na gosunyora chitukia chiabo. Nkabatiania ase erieta ria Nyasae, nkabateebia, “Timobaisa gosokia abaiseke baino ase abamura b’ebisaku ebio, gose konyuomeria abamura baino abaiseke babo; gose inwe abanyene timobaisa konyuoma korwa aroro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Sulemani, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, takorete ebibe ase engencho y’abakungu banga buna abwo? Ase abarwoti bonsi b’ebisaku, omorwoti onde tarenge buna ere, ekiagera Nyasae nigo amwanchete, na akamobeka akaba omorwoti igoro y’Abaisraeli bonsi. Nonya naboigo, abakungu baria b’ebisaku ebio bakagera agakora ebibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Nigo toragenderere koigwera amang’ana aino na tokore ebibe ebinene, naende tobe abatari abegenwa ase Nyasae oito, ase okonyuoma abakungu b’ebisaku ebiao?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyomo bw’abamura ba Yoyada, mosinto bw’Eliasibu, Omokuani omonene, konya onyuomire omoiseke o Sanibalati Omohoroni; ase ayio nkamoseria korwa ase ’nde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
